================================================================================
 Weight-2 dims on Gamma_0(2p): BULK (Eisenstein) vs OBSTRUCTION (cusp forms = genus)
================================================================================
  N=2p apex  #cusps dimEis=cusps-1  dimCusp=genus                   note
     6    3       4              3              0          LRC(6) SOLVED
    10    5       4              3              0    apex5 not Mers/Heeg
    14    7       4              3              1     LRC(14) FIRST HARD
    22   11       4              3              2                 apex11
    26   13       4              3              2                 apex13
 => BULK/Eisenstein is CONSTANT (=3, four cusps) across the family; OBSTRUCTION/cusp = genus
    grows 0,0,1,2,2. The genus is the DIMENSION of the missing global (cusp-form) modes.

