 NOTE: the doublet gap = min_k 2+2cos(2pi k/p) DECREASES with p (0.198 at 7) independent of genus;
 the genus distinction is GLOBAL (the cusp-form/obstruction dim), not the local gap-landscape min.
 Cross-check (persistence test for hardness=genus): genus 0 vs 1 is about the GLOBAL obstruction.
